[00:20.84]1. Gracious Jehovah, our strength and our might,
[00:30.36]You are our Savior, in you we delight.
[00:39.84]We are your Witnesses bearing your news,
[00:46.08]Whether men hear or they proudly refuse.
[00:52.90](Chorus)
[00:52.96]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[00:59.40]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[01:06.68]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[01:14.06]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[01:29.48]2. We who now serve you rejoice in your light;
[01:39.30]Eyes that are opened now see truth and right.
[01:48.95]Searching the Scriptures, we hear your command;
[01:55.21]Making our choice, for your Kingdom we stand.
[02:01.59](Chorus)
[02:01.75]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[02:08.01]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[02:15.25]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[02:22.45]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[02:54.60]3. Gladly, O God, we keep doing your will.
[03:02.78]Though Satan mocks us, we’re trusting you still.
[03:12.38]Though he may slay us, oh, help us to be
[03:18.64]Firm to the end for your grand Sov’reignty.
[03:25.00](Chorus)
[03:25.00]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[03:32.24]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[03:37.66]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[03:46.42]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
